{"meta":{"id":"tt1323594","type":"movie","name":"Mi villano favorito","imdb_id":"tt1323594","description":"En una alegre urbanización con cuidados jardines rodeados por verjas de madera pintadas de blanco y llenos de rosales, sobresale una casa negra con el césped amarillento. Los vecinos ignoran que debajo de la vivienda hay un enorme escondite secreto. Allí está Gru, rodeado por un pequeño ejército de lacayos, planeando el mayor robo de toda la historia. ¡Va a robarse con la luna!","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1323594.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2XSeKDmIa2KxaiJy4J9e8FrIZhk.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cYAsvh3Ju1nEUH799ePguv7ltq.png","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Crimen","Ciencia ficción","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2010","released":"2010-07-08T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"95 min","imdbRating":"7.6","country":"United States of America","cast":["Steve Carell","Jason Segel","Russell Brand","Miranda Cosgrove","Dana Gaier Ellis","Elsie Fisher","Pierre Coffin","Julie Andrews","Will Arnett","Kristen Wiig","Chris Renaud","Jemaine Clement","Jack McBrayer","Danny McBride","Mindy Kaling","Rob Huebel","Ken Daurio","Ken Jeong","Charles Bright","Katie Leigh","Ranjani Brow","Scott Menville","Holly Dorff","Edie Mirman","Jackie Gonneau","Al Rodrigo","Wendy Hoffmann","Jakob Roston","James Kyson","John Hans Tester"],"director":["Pierre Coffin","Chris Renaud"],"writer":["Ken Daurio","Cinco Paul","Stephan Franck","Keith Baxter","Javier Ledesma Barbolla","David Berthier","Steve Moore","Matt Flynn","Juan Pablo Navas Rosco","Mark O'Hare","John Holmquist","Juan De Dios Pozuelo","James W. Suhr","Sergio Pablos"],"trailers":[{"source":"hmTcQqJB5wE","type":"Trailer","name":"Mi villano Favorito Trailer español latino","ytId":"hmTcQqJB5wE","lang":"es"},{"source":"B7S4KodYFCM","type":"Trailer","name":"Gru, Mi Villano Favorito - Trailer","ytId":"B7S4KodYFCM","lang":"es"},{"sourc